{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.WeylCentre","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.WeylCentre","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Information.OuterDerivationResidue","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.Adjoin.Basic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.eq_algebraMap_of_commute_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.eq_algebraMap_of_commute_gen","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/WeylCentre.lean#L59-L69","doc":"**Weyl centre argument.** Let `A` be generated by a commutative set `F` and one element `D`.\nIf `f ∈ F` has `[D, f] = 0` and the centre of `A` is the scalars, then `f` is a scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.mem_center_of_commute_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.mem_center_of_commute_gen","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/WeylCentre.lean#L45-L57","doc":"**Commuting with the generators means central.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.not_isInner_of_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.not_isInner_of_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/WeylCentre.lean#L33-L37","doc":"**A nonzero derivation of a commutative algebra is outer.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.innerDerivation_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.innerDerivation_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/WeylCentre.lean#L28-L31","doc":"**Inner derivations of a commutative algebra vanish.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}